{"_type":"memory","key":"reference-regions","value":"Reference regions: Kaimai Range (Wairoa, Tuakopai, Mangakarengorengo?) and Tutamoe/Waima plateau Northland (Waima, Waipoua?, Mangakahia). Hypothesis: hard volcanic caprock plateau + high rainfall + escarpment incision -\u003e creeks."}
